        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;   Blue: user/UI &amp; workspace   •   Green: lifecycle ownership   •   Purple: daemon/state   •   Orange: execution pipeline   •   Red: Codex child processes" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D1D1D6;fontColor=#6E6E73;align=left;spacingLeft=12;arcSize=10;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
